      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu adalah dipinda dengan memasukkan,"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "selepas seksyen 70C, seksyen baru 70CA dan 70CB yang 70CA. (1) Notwithstanding anything to the contrary in this Act the Commission may, if it Committee considers expedient, authorise the Pilotage employees Committee to issue a licence to any employee of a licensed operator to pilot vessels in a pilotage district of the Commission subject to such terms and conditions as the Commission thinks fit: Provided that no such licence shall be issued to any such employee unless the Pilotage Committee has examined the employee and be satisfied as to the employee's general fitness and competency, including his physical fitness to act as a pilot for the licensed operator,"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/2/msa@/~cl_15__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/2/msa@/~cl_15",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "A licence issued under subsection (1) shall cease to be valid if the employee to whom it was issued ceases to be employed by the licensed operator. 70CB. No vessel shall be piloted in a pilotage district by any person other than the Commission Commission pilot or a person licensed under section 70CA(l).\"."
      }
    },
