      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu adalah dipinda dengan memasukkan,"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "seleoas seksven 86. seksven baru 86A yang berikut: Penalty for 86A. Any person who hinders or obstructs any hindrances member, officer or servant of the Commission or obstruc- tions to in the performance or execution of his duty or any in carrying out anything which he member, officer or empowered or required to do by virtue of or servant in consequence of this Act shall be guilty of of the Commis- an offence under this Act and shall, on sion. conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding one thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding six months or to both.\"."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/2/msa@/~cl_24",
