      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "seksyen 92e dengan seksyen 92E baru yang berikut: 92e. (1) The master, owner or agent of a vessel navigating in circumstances in which the vessel is required by the Commission under or licensed pilot under section 70B to be under pilotage who does not employ a Commission pilot or a person licensed under section 70cA(l) for such 12 RANG UNDANG-UNDANG purpose shall be guilty of an offence under this Act and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding five thousand ringgit."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/2/msa@/~cl_33__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/2/msa@/~cl_33",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Upon being found guilty of any offence under subsection (1), the Court before which the master, owner or agent of the vessel is found guilty shall order such master, owner or agent to pay to the Commission the amount certified by the accountant of the Commission to be the amount of dues and rates which would have been payable to the Commission if the vessel has been under pilotage as required by this Act and such amount shall be recoverable in the same manner as a fine.\"."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/2/msa@/~cl_34",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "34",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/2/msa@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 101 Akta ibu adalah dipinda dengan"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "memasukkan, selepas perkataan-perkataan \"this Act\", perkataan-perkataan \"or the regulations or by-laws made thereunder\"."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/2/msa@/~cl_35",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "35",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/2/msa@/~cl_35__subsec_2",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/2/msa@/~cl_35__subsec_3"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/2/msa@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu adalah dipinda dengan memasukkan,"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "selepas seksyen 101, seksyen baru 10AA yang berikut: Power to 101 A. (1) The Minister may by order to be compound published in the Gazette prescribe any offence offence. against the provisions of this Act or of any regulations or by-laws made thereunder as an offence which may be compounded by the Commission."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/2/msa@/~cl_35__subsec_2",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/2/msa@/~cl_35",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "The General Manager may in his discretion compound such offence prescribed under subsection (1) by accepting from the person reasonably suspected of having committed any such offence a sum of money not exceeding five hundred ringgit."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/2/msa@/~cl_35__subsec_3",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/2/msa@/~cl_35",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "The Minister may by the same order made under subsection (1) prescribe the method and procedure for compounding any offence against the provisions of this Act or of any regulations or by-laws made thereunder.\". (PINDAAN)"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/2/msa@/~cl_4",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/2/msa@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu adalah dipinda dengan menggantikan"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "seksyen 24(5) dengan seksyen 24(5) baru yang 24. \"(5) The Commission may give loans to its officers and servants for such purpose as may be approved by the Commission and on such terms and conditions as the Commission thinks fit.\". (PINDAAN)"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/2/msa@/~cl_5",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "hasPart": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/2/msa@/~cl_5__subsec_3A",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/2/msa@",
      "schema:name": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 25 Akta ibu adalah dipinda dengan"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "memasukkan selepas subseksyen (3) subseksyen baru"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/2/msa@/~cl_5__subsec_3A",
      "@type": "akn:subsection",
